}\n}\nrun();\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\find_company_phone_numbers","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Searching NICE BizINFO","toolSummary":"Search NICE BizINFO for 대경산업개발"}}]}
